<title>USA: St. Jude Medical buys Biocor Industria.</title>
<headline>St. Jude Medical buys Biocor Industria.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Jude Medical Inc said Monday it acquired tissue valve manufacturer Biocor Industria E Pesquisas Ltd of Belo Horizonte, Brazil.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Biocor's products are currently sold throughout Europe and Asia, the company said. Biocor's 100 employees will become employees of St. Jude Medical's heart valve disease management business, and operations will remain in Belo Horizonte.</p>
<p>St. Jude Medical also said it converted its Brazilian distribution organization in Sao Paulo to direct sales.</p>
<p>St. Jude Medical provides medical devices for the cardiovascular market.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
